<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,460.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,460.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,460 today from 1,450 on Feb 13, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1554    14.106	  1535    13.931</p>
<p>   1a   1503 11381.000	  1501 11369.000</p>
